<opsproc code="00008849.0001001" revdate="2018-04-05T16:26:15"><title>Cabin Overwing Exit Permanently Indicated Open on the <tech-label type="s-page">DOOR/OXY</tech-label></title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.005"><title>General information</title><procbody lid="N.00008849.0001001.006"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.007"><para code="00008849.0001001.010" layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.026">Indications
on the <abb>PTP</abb> or the <abb>FAP</abb><if-installed/> may be affected.</para></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.012"><title>After engine start</title><procbody lid="N.00008849.0001001.013"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00008849.0001001.003" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.014" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>In the case of false door alert:</intro><procbody lid="N.00008849.0001001.015"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.016" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008849.0001001.004"><challenge><tech-label type="pb">EMER CANC</tech-label></challenge><response>Press</response></cr-action><comment code="00008849.0001001.011"><note code="00008849.0001001.013" layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.030"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.031">the limitation <emph bold="false" color="Cyan" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="false">MAX FL : 100/MEA-MORA</emph> remains displayed on
the <tech-label type="s-page">STATUS</tech-label>.</para></note></comment></action></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.017"><title>BEFORE TAKEOFF</title><procbody lid="N.00008849.0001001.018"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.032"><cautionproc code="00008849.0001001.014" layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.033"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.027">The <tech-label type="pb">T.O CONFIG</tech-label> must be maintained pressed to check that there is no alert.</para></cautionproc></inform><action-block lid="N.00008849.0001001.019"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.020" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008849.0001001.005"><challenge><tech-label type="pb">T.O CONFIG</tech-label></challenge><response>Press</response></cr-action><comment code="00008849.0001001.006"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.028">In the T.O MEMO, the
"T.O CONFIG NORMAL" line will not replace the "T.O
CONFIG . . TEST" line.</para></comment></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.022" memory="false"><command code="00008849.0001001.007"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008849.0001001.023">Consider normal configuration
for takeoff provided that no alert was displayed during the T.O CONFIG
TEST.</para></command></action></action-block></procbody></procitem></opsproc>